  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v2.9.1 adds the TabularDataReader abstract base class, unifies zero-allocation UTF-8 parsing across columns and source-generated binders, delivers CSV SIMD and streaming throughput improvements (with runtime-async enabled on net11.0), consolidates internal generator and writer infrastructure, and fixes Excel numeric cell binding under non-invariant cultures. Changelog: https://github.com/KoalaFacts/HeroParser/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
